<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Campas et al. (2010) PNAS affine scaling-and-shear transformation + Abzhanov et al. (2004, 2006) Bmp4/Calmodulin beak morphogenesis + Soons et al. (2010-2015) reduced FEM fracture risk — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: 19 measurements, each with `reference_value`, `unit`, `method` and `reference_source` (L1845-L2061); the 10 Pass 3 measurements include two analytic FEM verifications (0.9925, 0.9905), a mesh convergence (0.0045), a 14-species tapered-beam slope (0.971, r = 0.9986), the Soons-2010 homeostasis ratio 0.432, the tip/base ratio 10.8, the oblique ratio 0.899, keratin shielding -0.036, BV/TV ablation 4.235 and a bone fracture-risk index 0.017; notes honestly state where the model disagrees with the recalled Soons claim. Deductions: the headline collapse metrics validate synthetic data (L266-L272) (-5); the RCAS reference value is computed from `D_over_L_obs` that are Law-2 formula outputs, not Abzhanov measurements (L1915-L1917) (-3); the negative-control reference 0.092 (L1905) and Certhidea shear RMS reference 0.012 (L1955) are the script's own output rounded, and r_DL reference 0.98 (L1945) is unsourced (-3); none of the FEM stresses or risk indices are compared with a measured or digitised stress value (every Pass 3 anchor is analytic, a null, or 'transcribed offline') (-3); the tip/base reference 3.07 is a naive lever estimate that disagrees with the value by design (L2014-L2019) (-1); convergence is checked for one species/case only (L1215-L1227) (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py L1905–L1905: Negative-control reference_value 0.092 is the script's own output (0.0937) rounded <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py#L1905-L1905>",
        "2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py L1915–L1917: RCAS reference_value = bmp.D_over_L_obs / nog.D_over_L_obs, where the 'obs' values are Law-2 formula outputs (ratio 3.8687 vs 'obs' 3.8745) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py#L1915-L1917>",
        "2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py L1945–L1955: r_DL reference 0.98 unsourced ('Gould 1845 & Campas Fig. 1'); Certhidea shear RMS reference 0.012 equals the script's 0.0120 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/2021-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling.py#L1945-L1955>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-cantilever-bending-stiffness-i-beam-w-d-3-12-l-vs-bite-force-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-universal-affine-scaling-and-shear-collapse-correlation-campas-et-al-2010>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-14-species-universal-affine-scaling-and-shear-collapse-rms-residual-campas-et-al-2010-fig-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-gould-1845-specimen-certhidea-olivacea-affine-shear-collapse-rms-vs-pure-scaling-control>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-gould-1845-specimen-cv-contour-d-l-correlation-across-4-finch-genera-darwin-finches-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-group-a-geospiza-6-species-pure-scaling-collapse-rms-residual-gamma-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-14-species-fem-tip-biting-structural-peak-vs-law-3-tapered-euler-bernoulli-estimate-log-log-slope>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-asymmetric-oblique-seed-load-14-species-mean-fem-structural-peak-ratio-30-deg-rostrocaudal-shear-component-normal-base-biting-load>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-fem-mesh-convergence-relative-change-of-g-magnirostris-structural-peak-bone-von-mises-stress-between-the-two-finest-meshes>,
