        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-q4-plane-stress-fem-verification-mid-span-bending-stress-sigma-xx-fem-euler-bernoulli-rectangular-cantilever>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-q4-plane-stress-fem-verification-tip-deflection-fem-timoshenko-rectangular-cantilever>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-soons-et-al-2010-stress-homeostasis-cv-of-14-species-fem-peak-bone-stress-under-each-species-own-bite-force-cv-of-bite-force>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-soons-et-al-2012-keratin-rhamphotheca-shielding-of-the-bone-core-at-e-k-1-5-gpa-bv-tv-0-55-14-species-mean-base-biting>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pass-3-soons-et-al-2015-load-position-asymmetry-14-species-mean-fem-structural-peak-ratio-tip-biting-base-biting>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-pure-scaling-negative-control-rms-residual-on-groups-b-c-without-shear-gamma-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-rcas-bmp4-vs-rcas-noggin-beak-aspect-ratio-d-l-modulation-ratio-abzhanov-et-al-2004-science>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-measurement-rcas-cam-elongation-aspect-ratio-reduction-d-l-cam-d-l-wt-abzhanov-et-al-2006-nature>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-alberti-avian-beak-darwin-scaling-morphometric-validation-1>,
